        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/q/a88e4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-27T04:34:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=850935430</p><div><strong>Guise has stolen presents from all the other heroes to keep for himself!</strong></div><div>\n<div><strong>Without shaking the boxes, can you figure out what each of them are and how he stole them?</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div><p>(Where a gift could be any of a set of cards, you just need to describe that set<span>. For example, Guise's present can be \"any Guise card\", because that's what you normally get when using his power)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe there were some better options, but at least with the match-up I chose, surviving to get cards from 5 different hero decks face down in Guise's play area was harder than I expected.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:42.292Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
