        "raw": "<p>http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=850935430</p><div><strong>Guise has stolen presents from all the other heroes to keep for himself!</strong></div><div><div><strong>Without shaking the boxes, can you figure out what each of them are and how he stole them?</strong></div><div>&nbsp;</div></div><p>(Where a gift could be any of a set of cards, you just need to describe that set<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">. For example, Guise&#39;s present can be &quot;any Guise card&quot;, because that&#39;s what you normally get when using his power)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe there were some better options, but at least with the match-up I chose, surviving to get cards from 5 different hero decks face down in Guise&#39;s play area was harder than I expected.</p>",
